What are the best classes for the particular conducts?  I put my guesses
here, but wait for your opinions:

vegan/vegetarian - monk of course.  Other are ranger and tourist, but
these have it harder to get intrinsics.  The worst - wizard, healer.

atheist - paradoxically priest (don't have to altar drop and can obtain
holy water by alchemy).  Don't know how with the other classes.

weaponless - monk again, also ranger  Worst - caveman, priest?

pacifist - no opinion.  For me it's still unbelieveable idea.  But maybe
tourist with his charm monster bonus or healer with level draining weapon?

illiterate = never tried, but I think it goes with hack'n'slash-ness of
the class.  Worst - except spellcasters I can't imagine tourist without
E-word.

genoless - wizard and all neutral characters (magicbane against liches)

polyselfless, polypileless, wishless - don't know.  My first ascension
had the first two unvoluntarily fulfilled (no /oPoly in the entire
game), so I don't know if there is any class-conduct interdependence.
Maybe wizards with starting MR are best here?

